# Review repair: default discovery/budgets and BLOCKED transport need design.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Search root field\nworkspace:read before inspection" {class: start}
Admission: "Admit every effective root\nDefaults or supplied roots\nCanonical scope + volume + prompt-risk policy"
Skip: "Do not enumerate blocked scope\nKeep root + skipped path + reason\nConsent state UNKNOWN; no consent identifier"
Scan: "Stream eligible names\nNo contents, index or handler lookup\nDefault discovery + budgets need rework"
Coverage: "One coverage object per root\nCOMPLETE / PARTIAL / UNKNOWN\nSearched scope + skipped remainder"
Available: "Some progress → AVAILABLE\nSorted bounded matches, possibly empty\nCoverage still states omissions"
Blocked: "No progress + no real failure + prompt-risk → BLOCKED\nmatches null; coverage survives\nError transport awaits producer decision"
Other: "No progress, other causes\nReal native/work failure → FAILED first\nOnly absent/excluded → dependency"
Publish: "Publish under live read authority\nInspect status, coverage AND errors\nResult truncation ≠ traversal coverage"
Start -> Admission: "1 · validate inputs"
Admission -> Skip: "2 · blocked / unsupported"
Admission -> Scan: "2 · admitted ordinary scope"
Skip -> Coverage: "3 · diagnostic only"
Scan -> Coverage: "3 · EOF, exclusion or bound"
Coverage -> Available: "4 · any root made progress"
Coverage -> Blocked: "4 · prompt risk, no real failure"
Coverage -> Other: "4 · no usable observation"
Available -> Publish: "5 · matches + coverage"
Blocked -> Publish: "5 · no list; transport unsettled"
Other -> Publish: "5 · distinct outcome"
